  "idea": "Automated sprint retro board with anonymous feedback collection",
  "text": "How remote engineering teams run honest, blameless sprint retrospectives that solve real bottlenecks. Standard Zoom retros breed awkward silence because junior engineers fear criticizing broken processes out loud. Unspoken friction festers across sprints, piling up technical debt while tanking team morale. Parabol automates anonymous retro boards that collect feedback, group similar topics, and conduct blind voting. Teams fix root operational issues without political friction.",
